{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99947","id":2211765347,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6D1Nxj","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99947","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99947.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99947.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99947","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99947/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99947/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99947/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2336415623189d2d63c5bce389156e618bdcc956","number":99947,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Ignore `__MACOSX` directory for export template and project ZIPs","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"macOS's Archive Utility (built-in ZIP file creator) apparently adds a secret `__MACOSX` directory to the files it zips. When Godot is unzipping archives it expects to have a specific structure, the presence of the `__MACOSX` directory and its subfiles can confuse it. For example, a macOS-zipped export templates file could not be imported because Godot was finding a dummy version of `version.txt` within `__MACOSX`.\r\n\r\nThis PR causes the export template importer and the project importer to skip any files in a zipped archive whose paths begin with `__MACOSX`. I've tested this with both a macOS-zipped export template file and a macOS-zipped project.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","number":20,"state":"closed","title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/fol